          "LE FUTUR SIMPLE = will. Fully",
          "productive from here on — same",
          "endings for every verb, added",
          "straight to the infinitive:",
          "",
          "je charger-ai   = I will charge     Press 1",
          "tu chargeras    = you will charge",
          "il/elle chargera = he/she will charge",
          "nous chargerons = we will charge",
          "vous chargerez  = you will charge",
          "ils chargeront  = they will charge",
          "",
          "-RE verbs drop the final -e first:",
          "vendre → je vendrai",
          "",
          "Same irregular stems as conditionnel",
          "(Tier 4): être→ser-, avoir→aur-,",
          "aller→ir-, faire→fer-, venir→viendr-."
        ],
        "pronunciation": "Leçon dix-neuf",
